---
import BaseHead from '../components/BaseHead.astro';
import Header from '../components/Header.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
import { SITE_TITLE, SITE_DESCRIPTION } from '../consts';
---
<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
	<head>
		<BaseHead title={SITE_TITLE} description={SITE_DESCRIPTION} />
	</head>
	<body>
		<Header />
		<main>
			<h1>🎬 Hi, I'm still figuring this out.</h1>
			<p>
				This is a webpage-style blog I'm using to post updates on my Jellyfin server, mostly so
				I stop forgetting what I've changed and can point people here instead of repeating myself
				for the fourth time. Fair warning: a lot of this is still very much a <strong>work in progress</strong>,
				in the same way that a house with no roof is technically "a work in progress."
			</p>

			<h2>So, what happened to Jellyfin?</h2>
			<p>
				For a while I was running a Docker and native Windows service hybrid setup, which sounds
				efficient and modern and was, in fact, neither. It caused a fairly relentless stream of
				problems, the kind that make you stare at a terminal window at 1am questioning your life
				choices. So I've done the sensible thing and ripped it all out: everything now runs as a
				<strong>full native Windows install</strong>. No more hybrid nonsense.
			</p>

			<h2>What's still cooking</h2>
			<p>
				Some things are still happening quietly in the background while I get everything settled.
				I'm also working on a few new features:
			</p>
			<ul>
				<li>A proper watchlist</li>
				<li>Better recommendations (the current ones are... optimistic, at best)</li>
				<li>Restoring a handful of older features that got left behind in the move</li>
			</ul>

			<h2>The bad news</h2>
			<p>
				User data got wiped in the process, so I've gone ahead and recreated everyone's profiles
				from scratch. Sorry about that — think of it as a fresh start, or a very inconvenient
				spring clean. If something's missing, wrong, or has mysteriously vanished, let me know.
				You know how to reach me. 🙂
			</p>
		</main>
		<Footer />
	</body>
</html>

<style>
	main {
		max-width: 720px;
		margin: 0 auto;
		padding: 3em 1.5em 4em;
		line-height: 1.7;
	}
	h1 {
		font-size: 2.1em;
		margin-bottom: 0.6em;
	}
	h2 {
		margin-top: 1.8em;
		margin-bottom: 0.4em;
		font-size: 1.3em;
		border-bottom: 2px solid var(--accent, #4c1d95);
		display: inline-block;
		padding-bottom: 0.15em;
	}
	p {
		margin: 0.8em 0;
	}
	ul {
		margin: 0.8em 0;
		padding-left: 1.4em;
	}
	li {
		margin: 0.4em 0;
	}
	strong {
		color: var(--accent, #4c1d95);
	}
</style>
